examples.question_text:
A cyclist slows at a constant rate from $8$ m/s to rest over $6$ seconds. Find the distance travelled.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.8cm,y=0.5cm,every node/.style={text=black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\definecolor{graphRed}{HTML}{EF6068}
\draw[->,black] (0,0)--(6.7,0);
\draw[->,black] (0,0)--(0,9);
\draw[thick,graphRed] (0,8)--(6,0);
\foreach \x in {0,2,4,6} {\draw[black] (\x,0)--(\x,-0.12);\path (\x,0) node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$\x$};}
\foreach \y in {2,4,6,8} {\draw[black] (0,\y)--(-0.12,\y);\path (0,\y) node[left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$\y$};}
\path (3,-1) node {Time (s)};
\path (-1.1,4) node[rotate=90] {Speed (m/s)};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

A car accelerates uniformly from rest to $12$ m/s in $6$ seconds, then maintains that speed until $16$ seconds. Find the total distance travelled.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.3cm,y=0.3cm,every node/.style={text=black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\definecolor{graphRed}{HTML}{EF6068}
\draw[->,black] (0,0)--(18,0);
\draw[->,black] (0,0)--(0,14);
\draw[thick,graphRed] (0,0)--(6,12)--(16,12);
\foreach \x in {0,6,16} {\draw[black] (\x,0)--(\x,-0.2);\path (\x,0) node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$\x$};}
\draw[black] (0,12)--(-0.2,12);
\path (0,12) node[left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$12$};
\path (8,-2.3) node {Time (s)};
\path (-3,7) node[rotate=90] {Speed (m/s)};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

examples.solution_text:
Split the region at $6$ seconds into triangle $A$ and rectangle $B$. The constant-speed stage lasts $16-6=10$ seconds.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.3cm,y=0.3cm,every node/.style={text=black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\definecolor{graphRed}{HTML}{EF6068}
\draw[->,black] (0,0)--(18,0);
\draw[->,black] (0,0)--(0,14);
\draw[thick,graphRed] (0,0)--(6,12)--(16,12);
\draw[dashed,black] (6,0)--(6,12);
\draw[dashed,black] (16,0)--(16,12);
\path (4,3) node {$A$};
\path (11,6) node {$B$};
\foreach \x in {0,6,16} {\path (\x,0) node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$\x$};}
\path (0,12) node[left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$12$};
\path (8,-2.3) node {Time (s)};
\path (-3,7) node[rotate=90] {Speed (m/s)};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

$\begin{aligned}d&=A+B\\&=\frac12\times6\times12+10\times12\\&=36+120\\&=156\text{ m}\end{aligned}$

examples.question_text:
A bus accelerates uniformly from rest to $18$ m/s by $5$ seconds, maintains that speed until $12$ seconds, then slows uniformly to rest at $18$ seconds. Find the total distance travelled.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.3cm,y=0.22cm,every node/.style={text=black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\definecolor{graphRed}{HTML}{EF6068}
\draw[->,black] (0,0)--(20,0);
\draw[->,black] (0,0)--(0,21);
\draw[thick,graphRed] (0,0)--(5,18)--(12,18)--(18,0);
\foreach \x in {0,5,12,18} {\draw[black] (\x,0)--(\x,-0.3);\path (\x,0) node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$\x$};}
\path (0,18) node[left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$18$};
\path (9,-3.2) node {Time (s)};
\path (-3,10) node[rotate=90] {Speed (m/s)};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

examples.solution_text:
The cruising stage lasts $12-5=7$ seconds; braking lasts $18-12=6$ seconds.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.3cm,y=0.22cm,every node/.style={text=black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\definecolor{graphRed}{HTML}{EF6068}
\draw[->,black] (0,0)--(20,0);
\draw[->,black] (0,0)--(0,21);
\draw[thick,graphRed] (0,0)--(5,18)--(12,18)--(18,0);
\draw[dashed,black] (5,0)--(5,18);
\draw[dashed,black] (12,0)--(12,18);
\path (3.3,5) node {$A$};
\path (8.5,9) node {$B$};
\path (14,5) node {$C$};
\foreach \x in {0,5,12,18} {\path (\x,0) node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$\x$};}
\path (0,18) node[left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$18$};
\path (9,-3.2) node {Time (s)};
\path (-3,10) node[rotate=90] {Speed (m/s)};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

$A$ and $C$ are triangles; $B$ is a rectangle.

$\begin{aligned}d&=A+B+C\\&=\frac12\times5\times18+7\times18+\frac12\times6\times18\\&=45+126+54\\&=225\text{ m}\end{aligned}$

examples.question_text:
A boat's speed increases uniformly from $4$ m/s to $10$ m/s over $6$ seconds. Find the distance travelled during these $6$ seconds.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.8cm,y=0.4cm,every node/.style={text=black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\definecolor{graphRed}{HTML}{EF6068}
\draw[->,black] (0,0)--(6.8,0);
\draw[->,black] (0,0)--(0,11.5);
\draw[thick,graphRed] (0,4)--(6,10);
\foreach \x in {0,2,4,6} {\draw[black] (\x,0)--(\x,-0.15);\path (\x,0) node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$\x$};}
\foreach \y in {2,4,6,8,10} {\draw[black] (0,\y)--(-0.12,\y);\path (0,\y) node[left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$\y$};}
\path (3,-1.7) node {Time (s)};
\path (-1.1,5.5) node[rotate=90] {Speed (m/s)};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

examples.solution_text:
Split the region into a rectangle of height $4$ m/s and a triangle of height $10-4=6$ m/s.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.8cm,y=0.4cm,every node/.style={text=black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\definecolor{graphRed}{HTML}{EF6068}
\draw[->,black] (0,0)--(6.8,0);
\draw[->,black] (0,0)--(0,11.5);
\draw[thick,graphRed] (0,4)--(6,10);
\draw[dashed,black] (0,4)--(6,4);
\draw[dashed,black] (6,0)--(6,10);
\path (3,2) node {$A$};
\path (4,5.7) node {$B$};
\foreach \x in {0,6} {\path (\x,0) node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$\x$};}
\foreach \y in {4,10} {\path (0,\y) node[left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$\y$};}
\path (3,-1.7) node {Time (s)};
\path (-1.1,5.5) node[rotate=90] {Speed (m/s)};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

$\begin{aligned}d&=A+B\\&=6\times4+\frac12\times6\times6\\&=24+18\\&=42\text{ m}\end{aligned}$

For a graph decreasing between two non-zero speeds, use the lower speed for the rectangle and the difference in speeds for the triangle.

examples.question_text:
The graph shows two runners' speeds. Runner A is the blue solid line; runner B is the green dashed line. Which runner travels further, and by how much?

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.45cm,y=0.5cm,every node/.style={text=black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\definecolor{graphBlue}{HTML}{268CFF}
\definecolor{graphGreen}{HTML}{4F9B63}
\draw[->,black] (0,0)--(13,0);
\draw[->,black] (0,0)--(0,9);
\draw[thick,graphBlue] (0,0)--(3,8)--(8,8)--(12,0);
\draw[thick,dashed,graphGreen] (0,0)--(4,6)--(8,6)--(12,0);
\foreach \x in {0,3,4,8,12} {\draw[black] (\x,0)--(\x,-0.12);\path (\x,0) node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$\x$};}
\foreach \y in {6,8} {\path (0,\y) node[left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$\y$};}
\path (6,8) node[above,text=graphBlue] {A};
\path (6,6) node[above,text=graphGreen] {B};
\path (6,-1.5) node {Time (s)};
\path (-1.8,4.5) node[rotate=90] {Speed (m/s)};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
